eguardian.com/us-news/2025/jun/10/trump-fires-usaid-overseas-employees">shrink the federal workforce</a>, roll back <a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/07/11/nx-s1-5890025/trump-administration-imperiled-wildlife">environmental protections</a> and policies intended to fight the <a href="https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/trump-rolls-back-landmark-policy-regulating-greenhouse-emissions">climate crisis</a>, reduced <a href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/29/us/politics/trump-university-research-funding.html">funding</a> for <a href="https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2025/12/02/upshot/trump-science-funding-cuts.html">scientific research</a> and is seeking to advance legislation that would impose new voting restrictions.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/jul/19/how-trump-and-his-administration-have-mired-the-us-in-multiple-crises">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;PSiXowBwb3KxmM7fAFFXp8ao45huNPBZewBjcOq9oxoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;Tv3Grm35F57TiivDzSFN8u9XPjn2ZuxIjdWBQqtZ4y4ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;F8uIcthF6F7tBrA1Z1YtkECfMJ0yaaGZxDNdUwcgD_0ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;NrIH79csrN1vMG9NfcgY3TwEPE1qW7Ao_rk_9HcQhLsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rVo3djNF925-iA4HbvS0clZVZjeetnt3tk2LKkP_HVEƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xLiDcdV6_syrcTD0C2nMODvZXp-KGY31ye9OKO3SVlwƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;VuRpeVLFyfLvE0f1Nl3QQZkmpsveYZv2Cr64HEzh_zIƒdpairƒerightd